# VeltOS: files no VeltOS window shows are not installed, which keeps the
# ISO and installed systems smaller (product owner, 2026-10-23; 105 MB of
# the compressed ISO, measured on the 2026-10-23 image):
#  * package documentation (mostly compressed changelogs), except each
#    package's copyright file, which keeps every licence on the system;
#  * KDE's default "Next" wallpaper (VeltOS has its own wallpapers).
# Shipped in the image, so packages installed later follow the same rule.
path-exclude=/usr/share/doc/*
path-include=/usr/share/doc/*/copyright
path-exclude=/usr/share/wallpapers/Next/*
